{"id":"a3e9105500b60a59","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-regular-algebra-language-map.md","title":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map — regular algebra language map","display":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map — regular algebra language map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map","display":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map — regular algebra language map","depends_on":["[[73-df-regular-language-algebra]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-regex-denotation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-regular-algebra-language-map","73-definition-2.3"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-regular-algebra-language-map — regular algebra language map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adc84a4e20d398f2\" href=\"?note=adc84a4e20d398f2\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-algebra\">73-df-regular-language-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-regular-algebra-language-map</span><span>73-definition-2.3</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,E_1,E_2\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\">\\(E,E_1,E_2\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adc84a4e20d398f2\" href=\"?note=adc84a4e20d398f2\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-algebra\">73-df-regular-language-algebra</a>；在本接口中它们本来就是语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为下述恒等语义映射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的语言连接，不是未定义的公式乘法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\cdot⟧_\\Sigma\">\\(⟦\\cdot⟧_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a>；本条末式只断言语义像与语言代数相等，不把语法树与语言对象相等同。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL\\coloneqq\\{(E,E):E\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL\\coloneqq\\{(E,E):E\\in\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL(E_1)\\cdot L(E_2)=\\{uv:u\\in L(E_1)\\land v\\in L(E_2)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL(E_1)\\cdot L(E_2)=\\{uv:u\\in L(E_1)\\land v\\in L(E_2)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL:\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)=\n\\{⟦ E⟧_{\\Sigma}:E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}2.3}\\vdash\nL:\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)=\n\\{⟦ E⟧_{\\Sigma}:E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原条目的语言连接等式并补上缺失的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(E)\">\\(L(E)\\)</span> 解释。有限树形式的正则表达式仍由独立的命名定义提供，两者不合并。</p>\n<p>语义像等式补足语言代数版本与语法树版本之间被下游使用的连接；L 仍为语言代数上的恒等映射，而非另一个语法解释器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regular-language-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"adc84a4e20d398f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-language-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"",